# Waking Dreams (battlefield.waking_dreams#exit, The Shrouded Maw): The exit NPC Memento_Circle gives the exit event
# 32003 (update option 1, finish option 4), then a warp out and the entry again.
lists TheShroudedMaw/MC_Entrance/onTrigger TheShroudedMaw/Memento_Circle/onTrigger TheShroudedMaw/onEventUpdate/32000 TheShroudedMaw/onEventFinish/32000 TheShroudedMaw/onEventUpdate/32003 TheShroudedMaw/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=TheShroudedMaw pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
quest Windurst.WakingDreams accepted
keyitem VialOfDreamIncense
login
trigger MC_Entrance
update 32000 option=33
finish
trigger Memento_Circle
update 32003 option=1
finish option=4
warp 0,0,0 TheShroudedMaw
trigger MC_Entrance
